# ---------------------------------------------------------------- 16.12.11 always
== ieee_16_12_11_always_after_implication_fails_p1
# evidence: derived
# 16.12.11 p1 (a ##1 b |=> always c): if a holds at the first tick and b at the second, c shall hold
# at every tick that follows the second. Derived trace: c is not required at samples 0 and 1 and
# holds at 2 and 3, but not at 4: attempt 0 fails at 4.
property: a ##1 b |=> always c
scope: attempt
clause: 16.12.11 16.12.7
class: normative
origin: IEEE 1800-2017 §16.12.11 p1, re-expressed
sample  : 0 1 2 3 4
a       : 1 . . . .
b       : . 1 . . .
c       : . . 1 1 .
outcome : F t t t t
decided : 4 1 2 3 4
fail    : . . . . 1
pending: 0

== ieee_16_12_11_always_after_implication_holds_p1
# evidence: derived
