== ieee_16_12_11_always_explicit_form_of_implicit_always
# evidence: derived
# 16.12.11: an assertion over p has one attempt per tick, equal to one evaluation of p at each tick of
# an attempt of always p. Derived trace for p = a |-> ##1 b: p is true at sample 0, fails at 2 (from
# sample 1) and at 4 (from sample 3). The always attempts starting at or before a failing offset
# fail at that offset's failure sample.
property: always (a |-> ##1 b)
scope: attempt
clause: 16.12.11 16.5
class: normative
origin: IEEE 1800-2017 §16.12.11 implicit_always / explicit_always, re-expressed
