== ieee_16_12_20_rule2_negated_sequence_in_consequent
# evidence: derived
# 16.12.20 rule2: a |-> not (b ##1 c ##1 d) negates the consequent sequence. Derived trace: attempt 0
# sees the sequence match at 2 (the property fails there); attempt 3 sees it break at 4 (true).
