== ieee_16_12_20_rule5_both_b_and_c_take_then_branch
# evidence: derived
# 16.12.20 rule5: b and c both hold at sample 2. The condition of the if is b, and b is true at the
# sample where the goto match ends, so the then-branch is the one selected (the if tests b, not c).
# d at 3 and e at 3: the inner implication holds; f is low, so the else-branch would have failed.
